{{also|needle-in-a-haystack}}
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|needle-in-a-haystack}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|En-au-needle in a haystack.ogg|Audio (AU)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|needles in a haystack|needles in haystacks}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} Something that is [[difficult]] or [[impossible]] to locate; something impossibly [[complex]] or [[intractable]].
#: ''You'll never find the paper you need on her desk. You're looking for a '''needle in a haystack'''.''

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|needle in a straw poll}}

